---
// Minimalist Antigravity-style Hero component with crisp contrast in all themes
---

<section class="hero-section">
	<div class="hero-inner">
		<h1 class="hero-title">
			Hola <span class="smiley">:D</span>
		</h1>
		
		<p class="hero-bio">
			Soy <strong class="text-strong">Edwin Rodriguez</strong>. Desarrollador especializado en backend, diseño de APIs robustas y arquitecturas web de alto rendimiento.
		</p>

		<div class="hero-status">
			<span class="status-indicator"></span>
			<span>Disponible para proyectos y vacantes full stack / backend</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.hero-section {
		padding: 5.5rem 2rem 4.5rem 2rem;
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.hero-inner {
		max-width: 820px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.75rem;
	}

	.hero-title {
		font-size: clamp(4rem, 11vw, 7.5rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: -0.045em;
		line-height: 0.95;
		color: var(--color-text);
		margin: 0;
		transition: color 0.25s ease;
	}

	.smiley {
		display: inline-block;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
		cursor: default;
	}

	.smiley:hover {
		transform: translateY(-4px) rotate(8deg);
	}

	.hero-bio {
		font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.4vw, 1.45rem);
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
		max-width: 680px;
		font-weight: 400;
		letter-spacing: -0.015em;
		transition: color 0.25s ease;
	}

	.text-strong {
		color: var(--color-text-strong);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.hero-status {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.65rem;
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}

	.status-indicator {
		width: 8px;
		height: 8px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background-color: #10b981;
		box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.6);
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.hero-section {
			padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 3rem 1.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
